# Line endings are part of a file's bytes, and this repository hashes some of
# them: `_generated/GENERATED.md` records the SHA-256 of `openapi/…json` so a
# later regeneration can be read as a spec change or a generator change.
#
# Without this file, a checkout on Windows converted every text file to CRLF
# while the index holds LF, so the same committed spec hashed differently there
# than on Linux -- measured 2026-09-08, the first Windows CI run failed on
# exactly that (audit OPS-4).
#
# LF everywhere, in the index and in every working tree. Every file in this
# repository is text; git's own inspection lists none as binary, so `text=auto`
# has nothing to misjudge.
* text=auto eol=lf
